@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-88534
+notes:
+  quiz_statistics:
+    - message: >-
+        The delay before quiz statistics are recalculated after an attempt is
+        submitted or deleted is now configurable via the new
+        quiz_statistics/recalculatedelay admin setting (default 1 hour), and the
+        recalculation is now de-bounced: each new submission or deletion pushes
+        the queued \quiz_statistics\task\recalculate task back by the configured
+        delay, rather than queueing a run a fixed time after the first change.
+        Use recalculate::get_delay() instead of the recalculate::DELAY constant
+        to obtain the delay. A new recalculate::queue_immediate_run() method has
+        been added to queue an immediate run of the task for a quiz.
+      type: changed
